+/*  Under the layers list, for the active layer when it has effects:
+ *
+ *    ▾ fx  Effets   Ombre portée, Contour            👁
+ *          👁  Ombre portée                          ✎
+ *          👁  Contour                               ✎
+ *
+ *  - the header shows / hides the list (remembered for the session);
+ *  - each eye shows / hides one effect, the header's eye all of them
+ *    (as the « fx » popover of the layer row);
+ *  - ✎ or a double click on the name edits the effect (same code as the
+ *    popover's « edit » button).
+ *
+ *  The rows of the layers list stay one per layer (GimpContainerTreeStore
+ *  rows are viewables): a true child row per effect would have touched
+ *  the whole container view machinery, hence this compact strip.  The
+ *  « fx » cell of the layer row still opens the full popover (reorder,
+ *  merge, copy, delete).
+ */
+
