+ * Copyright (C) 1995 Spencer Kimball and Peter Mattis
+ *
+ * chopgimp-rc.c — ChopGimp: small persistent settings, kept in
+ * ${gimp_dir}/chopgimprc (a key file), for options that have no place
+ * in gimprc: thumbnail cropping, hidden panel column…
